{"server":"tw","storyId":"act27side_level_act27side_04_end","groupId":"act27side","stageId":"act27side_04","title":"一個水手出海了","storyCode":"SL-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act27side/level_act27side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"eeebe678f589577db3cfbdf6e723afee4762ced96fe5cd693a7432ccbc332123","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"艾雅法拉忙於追回被小黑羊“偷走”的展品，卻被多利帶去“享受生活”。在一片混亂中，她追進了知更鳥咖啡店，店主的孫子科斯達也在與她對話中回憶起了過去的凱勒。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，看起來已經收拾完了。不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多利先生！你不覺得你應該管一管你的分身們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道放任它們這樣鬧下去，會給這裡的人造成多大的麻煩嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"毛絨絨的生物站在貨櫃上，它的頭壓得很低，似乎想向面前的人表現出歉意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了，他們不完全是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然確實是我把他們帶到這裡來的......但這也只能算是間接責任吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......對不起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不是一句對不起就能解決的呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些商品要是受損了，那些店主們要怎麼辦呢？你的分身打擾了居民們的生活，就沒有什麼辦法能阻止它們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"方法還是有的......那個，一般情況下，我會選擇用“呼喊”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“呼喊”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像這樣，對著隨便哪裡，可以是海，可以是荒地，兩個手攏在嘴邊，然後大聲地：“喂——你們都在哪裡！快點給我過來！”這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿黛爾，你也要幫幫我才行，我喊的次數太多了，他們有時會裝作沒聽到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......喊它們過來就可以了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還要有點能誘惑他們的東西。比如“這裡有冰淇淋！”“這裡有氣球和滑板！”這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但要記住，不要叫他們“小黑羊”或者“小羊”，他們會不知道這是在叫他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"多利期待地看向身邊的阿黛爾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——！這裡有冰淇淋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——！這裡有氣球和滑板！快過來吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？冰淇淋？是免費的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，真的有嗎？我想要草莓味的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是在做什麼活動嗎？有氣球可以領？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？不是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿黛爾回頭，想指出始作俑者。多利已經躍上一旁的貨櫃，像漏氣的氣球一樣圍著幾人打圈。\n但是路人們都看不到它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，出狀況了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你要先和他們一起去吃冰淇淋才行了，可能還要去買氣球，去逛街，去曬曬汐斯塔的太陽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦呢？我碰巧還知道一家非常好吃的冰淇淋店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不要我領路帶你們去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......多利先生！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g3_siestanewstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以這是你們火山博物館的攬客手段嗎？給路人買冰淇淋吃？那我還真的蠻喜歡的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"親愛的，我們要不下午就去博物館轉轉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，逛完博物館我們再去吃燒烤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走走走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，謝謝你們啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿黛爾目送著幾人走遠，環顧四周，試圖找到多利的身影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"街上人來人往，多利早就消失不見，只有一隻小黑羊正死死盯著來往遊客手裡那個能“變出”紙鈔來的小皮夾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......它準備做什麼？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就在遊客和老闆討價還價時，小黑羊縱身一躍——\n一口叼走了遊客手裡的錢包。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（欸？！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"//之后换成夏活战斗音乐"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"我的錢包呢？！誰偷走了我的錢包！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"汐斯塔市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你的錢包長什麼樣？黑的白的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"汐斯塔市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就剛剛嗎？但我好像沒看到有什麼人啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（糟糕了，多利先生也不在，我得趕緊把它抓住！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"叼著錢包的小黑羊注意到了阿黛爾，它鬆了口，錢包掉了下來——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"又伸出蹄子輕輕一踢，錢包在空中劃出弧線，正好落回它身上的絨毛裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"毛絨絨的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1008_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（快樂地撲騰）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"錢包像是撞到了什麼東西，“咣”的一聲，一塊佈滿小孔的石頭從小黑羊身上滾落出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是，響石！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小黑羊回頭看看，趁石頭落地之前，又忙用蹄子把石頭也踢回絨毛中。\n隨後它向阿黛爾吐舌頭做了個鬼臉，轉身向風情街奔去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！你等一等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把別人的東西還回來——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舊幣商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"三分的錯版金券在我們這裡可都是少有的收藏品，等到博覽會開始能賣大價錢！小姑娘，真的不考慮一下嗎？我可以給你這個價！"},{"type":"narration","text":"商人比畫出一個數字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1005_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？那你看看這個呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舊幣商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"是東國的舊幣，我收，這個價！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1005_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這個呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舊幣商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"是高盧銅里亞，我也收！小姑娘，你還有什麼，都拿出來好了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舊幣商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，你到底帶了多少東西出來？最後一個，真的是最後一個了......收完最後一個，我就要回去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1005_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那您再看看這個！我的錢就夠買一個新機器了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舊幣商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊，是我們薩爾貢的錢幣......讓我來看看，這是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舊幣商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"——嘉維爾？！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1005_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！這個值錢嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舊幣商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"值錢嗎？不！這個生意我不做了！我和細尾巴的沒什麼話要說！這些東西你都拿回去！我要走了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"商人抓起一把零碎的錢幣，憤怒地往雪雉懷裡塞，想要離開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"突然，不知什麼東西飛馳而過，撞開了他握緊錢幣的手。\n金燦燦的錢雨落在商業街的一角，雪雉的一聲驚呼還沒出口，一個粉色的身影也緊跟著跑向遠方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1005_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊、艾雅法拉小姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，雪雉......我......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舊幣商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！什麼東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1005_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我的錢幣......少了兩個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舊幣商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不是我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"叮噹，毛絨絨的生物把金燦燦的小圓片藏進自己的絨毛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊士曼先生！我來拿我要列印的資料了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影印店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，印這麼多傳單，為了宣傳你家的酒吧你還真是夠辛苦的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩百九十八、兩百九十九......數量沒錯，您的費用！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影印店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這點東西就不收錢了，下次再去純白火山，給我來一杯多加豆蔻粉的“綠洲”特調就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影印店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有，能不能幫忙換一下我的招牌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然好啊，多謝您了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——埃、埃尼斯先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿黛爾小姐......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您跑這麼快幹嘛？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心......小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沒等埃尼斯反應過來，一股巨大的衝擊力撞在他身上。在浮空的那一瞬，他看到了傾倒的汐斯塔，紙張散落得到處都是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......痛痛痛......什麼東西......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小黑羊叼起其中一張紙，繼續朝著前方奔去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，埃尼斯先生！對——對不起！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"//暂定这个表情"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在幾人的注視下，阿黛爾追著那張“被風吹走”的紙跑遠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影印店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼，時代真是不一樣了，現在的年輕人都這麼趕時間啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪事了，剛是什麼把我撞飛了......？我這輩子還沒遇到過比這還奇怪的事情......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"轟——！\n伊士曼影印店的招牌掉了下來，正落在埃尼斯被氣浪撞飛前站的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哇！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑到哪裡去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像是捉迷藏一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多利先生，現在不是玩耍的時候！不及時把那些小黑羊抓回來的話，還會有其他人丟東西的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，東西不會丟，只是被借走玩一小會兒，他們會還回去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你為什麼從來不和別的同齡的孩子玩耍呢？哪怕是在這樣的夏天也要把自己關在實驗室裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多利先生，我已經不是小孩了，汐斯塔火山研究是一項很重要的工作，我不該分心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，現在找到那些小黑羊阻止它們繼續胡鬧也很重要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道很多孤獨的孩子，都喜歡用忙於工作當藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這家店看起來沒有人啊，可是小黑羊剛剛......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......你是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打擾了，我......我養的寵物跑丟了！我好像看到它剛才跑到了這間咖啡館裡......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿黛爾說著抬頭看了看，店門上用好看的字體寫著“知更鳥咖啡店”幾個單詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這家咖啡館一年前就沒有營業過了，門一直是鎖著的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我剛剛確實看到，它鑽到這個門裡去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你丟的是什麼寵物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......是循獸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦不！不要把我的分身和那種動物相提並論......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，循獸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"科斯達從口袋裡摸出了一把鑰匙，插進門鎖裡，幾聲陳舊的摩擦聲響後，門緩緩打開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"房間很暗，窗簾全部放下，陽光透不進來多少。\n空氣中灰塵彌漫，混著陳舊的咖啡豆的味道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要找的循獸在裡面嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，好像不在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉！打擾您了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，正好我也要來取點東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"產權證我記得是放在......不在嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您是這裡的店主嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很快就不是了。這家店，還有這條街上其他的店，很快都會拆掉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很遺憾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，這裡早就通知說要拆了......嘶，怎麼櫃子裡也沒有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"店主先生，您要找的大概是什麼樣的？我幫您找找看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是一個紅色的冊子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這裡真的好黑啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，你在這裡真的能看到什麼嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡很久不營業，開燈可能有些麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是找不到就算了，我也沒有那麼著急，你先去找你的寵物吧，我......也會幫你留意一下的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧孩子！分身和你要找的什麼石頭都不在這裡，我們去下一個地方吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡太黑了......什麼都看不到，和我之前在汐斯塔衝浪的時候看到的完全不一樣！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，它長什麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，是一隻粉白色的......循獸，身上還帶著一塊只有火山上會有的，風吹過就會響的石頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風吹過就會響的石頭......“響石”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？是的，是“響石”。您怎麼知道？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"科斯達繼續翻找著，他拽開一個已經落滿灰塵的櫃子，一把陳舊吉他掉了出來，正正砸在他的腳邊。\n嘣——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！店主先生，您沒事吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"像是演奏著一般，這把吉他發出撞擊後的震動餘聲，嗡嗡作響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——那種石頭被風吹時就會發出這樣的聲音，像樂器演奏一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，扯遠了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔哦，浪漫呢，響石就像吉他？我之前怎麼沒想到？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的寵物身上帶著這樣一塊石頭是嗎？還真是怪奢侈的。我記得這種石頭還挺稀有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是它自己偷偷拿走的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......臉要丟盡了，不要告訴人類我的分身還會亂拿東西......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，如果我看到了，我會聯繫你的。你的聯繫方式是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝您！可以的話請聯繫火山博物館吧，我是那裡的工作人員，我叫阿黛爾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知道又碰到了什麼東西，櫥櫃中的那堆舊物也稀哩嘩啦地掉落在了地上，蓋住了地上的吉他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您真的不需要我幫忙嗎？您看起來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情緒狀態不是很好......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一本書落在阿黛爾的視線中，借著外面的天色，她看清了書的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《泰拉火山圖志》？您也對火山感興趣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是......不，也不是不喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我是說，這個不是我的書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們先出去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在火山博物館工作，那你認識......凱勒嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說凱勒老師嗎？你們是朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她以前......算是這裡的常客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一年夏天，她突然離開了汐斯塔，和兩個萊塔尼亞人一起。之後就沒有聯繫過了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她最近怎麼樣？她在博物館裡......還不錯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，凱勒老師最近一直忙於汐斯塔火山的觀測準備，博物館也還在完善中，她很忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她和你一樣都在博物館工作嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？凱勒老師是館長呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"館長......真厲害啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科斯達","speakerId":"avg_npc_997_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......如果可以的話，請幫我把這本書還給凱勒......館長吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"藏到哪了，藏到哪了，快點找找吧♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記住花朵的模樣，我可能就躲在它身後♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小黑羊蹦蹦跳跳，最後停在了一盞路燈上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小黑羊蹦跳起來，像一朵被風吹散的雲一樣，消失在了阿黛爾眼前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"叮零噹啷，一塊小石頭、幾枚錢幣、一張白紙、一個錢包，掉落在地上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"捉迷藏♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多利先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你今天沒有一整天都悶在博物館裡，你出來走了走，吃了冰淇淋，買了氣球，陽光很不錯，人也很和善，你還認識了新朋友，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是生活！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要的種子到底是什麼？是這塊小石頭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要慢慢找，不要著急，明天的陽光也會很好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"藏到哪了，藏到哪了，快點找找吧♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是這些錢幣？還是這張紙上的東西？......“搬遷意向書”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"種子是咖啡豆嗎，多利先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記住花朵的模樣，我可能就躲在它身後♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
